{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112259896364429312","3_2112259915347832832"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:09:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112259925984543076"],"id":"2112259925984543076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":135,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#121 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street. Good pandal and pratima. https://t.co/g3O6wWqjaR","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112259925984543076"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112258664941957120","3_2112258679261319169","3_2112258694268559360","3_2112258711859437568"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:04:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112258724748493179"],"id":"2112258724748493179","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":251,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#120 Visited Hatibagan Sarbojanin. https://t.co/WkM9YufIe9","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112258724748493179"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112249016528539648"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112249040251637894"],"id":"2112249040251637894","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3729,"like_count":86,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":15},"text":"Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"},{"author_id":"1503676494669049856","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:53:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112225699780350376"],"id":"2112225699780350376","in_reply_to_user_id":"1023150691030728704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":149,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112223634911895602","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@an1sh123 @abasu4ever Oo I see..but sovabazar kumartuli area was fully crowded... Kumartuli park had the queue so crowded in that small ally that we didn't go due to fear ..and Bagbazar was giving proper Asthami crowd and vibes as usual.","url":"https://x.com/SuvamDu76552490/status/2112225699780350376"},{"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:45:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112223634911895602"],"id":"2112223634911895602","in_reply_to_user_id":"1503676494669049856","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112190443090063544","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@SuvamDu76552490 @abasu4ever I just returned from hatibagan, Kashi Bose Lane, manicktala area. Crowd is non existent. Hatibagan is little crowded but nothing compared to other areas. Kashi Bose Lane had no crowd at all. Normally it takes at least 30 mins to get in in evening peak time. But not today","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112223634911895602"},{"author_id":"2609353712","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111894883359485991"],"id":"2111894883359485991","in_reply_to_user_id":"1780314375548518400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":75,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111891376036274226","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@jktaelove276069 Samee! I visited yesterday as well. The last pandal, before the severe downpour, which abruptly halted all of our further plans. Took provisional shelter at the Ahiritola Ghat untill the rain subsided. 🙁","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111894883359485991"},{"author_id":"276205348","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:07:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111715691518894438"],"id":"2111715691518894438","in_reply_to_user_id":"1622627412717744128","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111537980225778005","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@02mitroooon @ThaneOfTracks Mishti dichhilo Kashi bose lane,ageo dieche. Ei kashi bose lane e agerbar ja ta crowd mgmt korechilo.","url":"https://x.com/Cohle1878/status/2111715691518894438"},{"author_id":"1674681718895411201","created_at":"2026-10-18T06:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111707069191729395"],"id":"2111707069191729395","in_reply_to_user_id":"3236685834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":85,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111671635707314677","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@goonereol I haven’t been there in recent times but I was turned away from Kashi Bose lane the year before on tritiya. Majority pandals have always opened from choturthi panchami only. Last year on choturthi there was still work going on in sikdar Bagan and nabinpally didn’t allow us in.","url":"https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2111707069191729395"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:59:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111653404691071073"],"id":"2111653404691071073","in_reply_to_user_id":"60282284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":79,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111621420472246638","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@mrs__hazel On Saptami 2024, a heavy downpour happened for almost 40/45 mins, starting at around 7pm ... I , at that very moment, was at the Ahiritola Pujo which probably was one of the best that year... The police took barely 2 to 3 mins to clear our the entire queue ...","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111653404691071073"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:43:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111649366587154726"],"id":"2111649366587154726","in_reply_to_user_id":"2044335618512076800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111531598130889212","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AarKiBolboBolo2 It rained last year too... There was a downpour on Ashtami during 2024 too... In 2024 , I was at the Ahiritola pujo when the downpour started and it took the administration just a couple of minutes to clear our the entire queue","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111649366587154726"},{"author_id":"803197771389861888","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111518921622999095"],"id":"2111518921622999095","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":4726,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"I’m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. ❤️\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab","url":"https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"},{"author_id":"70626051","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:43:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111437874298232933"],"id":"2111437874298232933","in_reply_to_user_id":"707265157659893761","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111334695694921759","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Abhijit_Basak83 Good work, great lighting. But crowd management poor. Santosh Mitra Square, Ahiritola stands out.","url":"https://x.com/wanderlust1587/status/2111437874298232933"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111427835042885632"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:03:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111427846212342175"],"id":"2111427846212342175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":5157,"like_count":682,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":25},"text":"#29 Visited Ahiritola Sarbojonin— an absolute stunner by Subrata Mridha. https://t.co/xTarrNUaD8","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111427846212342175"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111355515628552192","3_2111355534897262592","3_2111355550504255488","3_2111355563774984192"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-17T07:16:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111355574420230404"],"id":"2111355574420230404","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":412,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#73 Visited Naktala Udayan Sangha. They are back from their downfall after arrest of \"অপা\". One of the best theme of Kolkata this year. Their theme is \"কাল ধ্বনি\". They have illustrated the history, importance and impact of Panjikas. Beautifully executed. Absolutely recommend it. https://t.co/BIrqvmTgN1","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111355574420230404"},{"author_id":"1380447272261939206","created_at":"2026-10-16T17:27:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111147024448094701"],"id":"2111147024448094701","in_reply_to_user_id":"1390332270041436162","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111146591268593868","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@wheeinthegay shyambazar hatibaagan/shovabazar area puro sudhu kashi bose lane ta miss hoyeche crowd management was very bad but nalin sarkaar street ta shera chilo maar pith kore dekhechi","url":"https://x.com/itsayrawr/status/2111147024448094701"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111130487549050880","3_2111130501486608384","3_2111130514396770304","3_2111130527109681152"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-16T16:21:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111130536941064655"],"id":"2111130536941064655","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":8634,"like_count":748,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":50},"text":"#24 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street— A Sanatan Dinda masterclass. He loves to play with colours &amp; he absolutely nails it here. https://t.co/iw8Y3Or6Hr","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111130536941064655"},{"author_id":"2074369902341918720","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:54:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111078359392502113"],"id":"2111078359392502113","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"North Kolkata’s Durga Puja Themes 2026: Which Pandals Stand Out?\n\nKashi Bose Lane: ‘আদিম’\nNabin Pally\nKumartuli\nAhiritola\nPandal-hopping plans\n\nDiscover what makes Durga Puja 2026 worth exploring. Watch the video for a closer look 👇\nhttps://t.co/6GobBLX8jy","url":"https://x.com/Mchatterjee099/status/2111078359392502113"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110977127692877825"]},"author_id":"819130177","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:12:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110977142549029164"],"id":"2110977142549029164","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"পুজো মানেই আনন্দ, পুজো মানেই মিলন। তাই উৎসবের আলো ছড়িয়ে পড়ুক সবার ঘরে—প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষমদের পাশে দাঁড়িয়ে পুজোকে সবার করে তোলার উদ্যোগ রাজ্যের নগরোন্নয়ন ও পুর বিষয়ক দপ্তরের। বুধবার দক্ষিণ কলকাতার সুরুচি সঙ্ঘের প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষম মানুষদের জন্য বিশেষ ‘রেস্টিং https://t.co/MfwVI7Pcpr","url":"https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2110977142549029164"},{"author_id":"2984417534","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:56:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110716323819082115"],"id":"2110716323819082115","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3892,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":10},"text":"LIVE : টালা বারোয়ারি সার্বজনীন শ্রীশ্রী দুর্গাপুজোর শুভ উদ্বোধন অনুষ্ঠানে উপস্থিত আছেন কেন্দ্রীয় মন্ত্রী @DrSukantaBJP  https://t.co/5Q4NykGfQ8","url":"https://x.com/BJP4Bengal/status/2110716323819082115"},{"author_id":"1148102359","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:41:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110697495278084237"],"id":"2110697495278084237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":570,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Beautiful Durga Puja at Kashi Bose Lane. \nBeautiful inauguration by CM\n\nhttps://t.co/WH7Ago9T9U\n\nNow think of how monstrous remote inauguration would have been","url":"https://x.com/sarkar_swati/status/2110697495278084237"},{"author_id":"1895446981386162176","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:26:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110633432384741810"],"id":"2110633432384741810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"কলকাতার দুর্গাপুজোয় ‘মহা মিলন’ থিম, ঢাকুরিয়া শহিদনগরে উদ্বোধন রাজ্যপাল আর এন রবির\n#KolkataDurgaPuja #MahaMilan #RNRavi #DhakuriaSahidnagar #DurgaPuja2026 #SuruchiSangha #Ahiritola #WestBengal #newslivebangla\n https://t.co/gxfNagrea9","url":"https://x.com/Newslive_Bangla/status/2110633432384741810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110443772169592832","13_2110443772165414912"]},"author_id":"1312456956645343234","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:56:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110444664058982460"],"id":"2110444664058982460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4191,"like_count":97,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Avik's Great Durga Pujo Pandal hopping night out log (1/n)\n\nAhiritola: Homage to sweets of Bengal - impressive idol design - pandal missing the final touches here and there but efficient use of limited space - 7/10. https://t.co/9AE6HOJBzd","url":"https://x.com/just_avik/status/2110444664058982460"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110248752569360384"]},"author_id":"62762183","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110248778200682765"],"id":"2110248778200682765","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2544,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA","url":"https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4715,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_2112259896364429312","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBLzwa8AADwpD.jpg","width":2448},{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_2112259915347832832","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBM6easAAggxh.jpg","width":2448},{"height":2448,"media_key":"3_2112258664941957120","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBAEIWbMAA-zUl.jpg","width":3264},{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_2112258679261319169","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBAE9sbUAElRaw.jpg","width":2448},{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_21122586942685